ver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/popover","content":"`PopoverTrigger` wraps a trigger button and a `<Popover>`, handling open state and positioning automatically.\nBased on RAC `DialogTrigger`. To anchor a popover to an element it doesn't wrap, pass `triggerRef` instead."},"1079":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-14","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/popover#default","content":"Use it with `<PopoverTrigger>`, which wraps both the popover content and an interactive trigger element (for example, a `Button`)."},"1080":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-15","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/popover#custom-anchor","content":"To position a popover relative to a different element than its trigger, use the `triggerRef` and `isOpen` props instead of `<PopoverTrigger>`. `onOpenChange` is called when the user opens or closes the popover."},"1081":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-16","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/popover#title-and-close-button","content":"Add a `Heading slot=\"title\"` and a `CloseButton` for a titled, dismissible popover. The heading\nalso gives the dialog its accessible name."},"1082":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-17","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/popover#keyboard","content":"Key"},"1083":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-18","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/popover#keyboard","content":"Action"},"1084":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-19","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/popover#keyboard","content":"`Enter/Space`"},"1085":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-20","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/popover#keyboard","content":"Opens the popover from its trigger"},"1086":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-21","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/popover#keyboard","content":"`Escape`"},"1087":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-22","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/popover#keyboard","content":"Closes the popover"},"1088":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-23","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/popover#aria","content":"`role=\"dialog\"` is applied automatically by the underlying React Aria `Dialog`"},"1089":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-24","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/popover#aria","content":"A `Heading slot=\"title\"` labels the dialog via `aria-labelledby`. Without one, a popover inside\na `PopoverTrigger` falls back to being labelled by its trigger; standing alone with\n`triggerRef` it needs an explicit `aria-label`"},"1090":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-25","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/popover#best-practices","content":"Pass an `aria-label` when anchoring with `triggerRef` instead of wrapping a `PopoverTrigger`,\nsince there is no trigger to borrow the name from."},"1091":{"id":"/docs/components/popover-26","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/popover#best-practices","content":"Popover width is determined by its content, and it's recommended to keep it under 400px."},"1092":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-bar","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-bar","type":"page","content":"ProgressBar","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/progress-bar"},"1093":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-bar-0","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-bar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/progress-bar","content":"Composable determinate or indeterminate progress with optional label, value, and description"},"1094":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-bar-1","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-bar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/progress-bar#installation","content":"Installation"},"1095":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-bar-2","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-bar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/progress-bar#examples","content":"Examples"},"1096":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-bar-3","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-bar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/progress-bar#default","content":"Default"},"1097":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-bar-4","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-bar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/progress-bar#sizes","content":"Sizes"},"1098":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-bar-5","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-bar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/progress-bar#statuses","content":"Statuses"},"1099":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-bar-6","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-bar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/progress-bar#indeterminate","content":"Indeterminate"},"1100":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-bar-7","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-bar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/progress-bar#without-value-label","content":"Without Value Label"},"1101":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-bar-8","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-bar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/progress-bar#without-label","content":"Without Label"},"1102":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-bar-9","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-bar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/progress-bar#value-display","content":"Value Display"},"1103":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-bar-10","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-bar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/progress-bar#slots","content":"Slots"},"1104":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-bar-11","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-bar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/progress-bar#customization","content":"Customization"},"1105":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-bar-12","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-bar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/progress-bar#accessibility","content":"Accessibility"},"1106":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-bar-13","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-bar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/progress-bar#props","content":"Props"},"1107":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-bar-14","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-bar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/progress-bar#progressbar","content":"ProgressBar"},"1108":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-bar-15","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-bar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/progress-bar#default","content":"Compose a label, formatted value, track, and description."},"1109":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-bar-16","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-bar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/progress-bar#sizes","content":"Three track heights are available: `xs` (6px), `sm` (12px), and `md` (24px)."},"1110":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-bar-17","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-bar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/progress-bar#statuses","content":"Use `status` to communicate intent and a description for additional context."},"1111":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-bar-18","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-bar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/progress-bar#indeterminate","content":"Use indeterminate progress while the total is unknown. Value output is hidden automatically."},"1112":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-bar-19","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-bar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/progress-bar#without-value-label","content":"Omit the value slot to hide visible value output. Accessible progress is preserved."},"1113":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-bar-20","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-bar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/progress-bar#without-label","content":"Compose only the track for progress in a table or fixed position. Supply an accessible name.\nAdd a value slot when a visible value is useful."},"1114":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-bar-21","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-bar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/progress-bar#value-display","content":"The value slot shows formatted text by default and accepts custom children.\nStatic content does not change the accessible value; set the root's valueLabel when needed."},"1115":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-bar-22","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-bar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/progress-bar#slots","content":"Box slots receive the formatted value and decorative track from ProgressBar.\nUse the root's render function for custom value content. Text can also fill the value slot."},"1116":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-bar-23","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-bar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/progress-bar#customization","content":"Use `Box slot=\"value\"` for formatted or custom content, or `Text slot=\"value\"` for typography controls.\nThe root's children render function provides progress state. Customize layout and styling with\nGrid props, `className`, and `style`."},"1117":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-bar-24","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-bar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/progress-bar#accessibility","content":"Provide `Label`, `aria-label`, or `aria-labelledby` for the accessible name."},"1118":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-bar-25","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-bar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/progress-bar#accessibility","content":"Progress remains accessible without a visible value. Use `valueLabel` to customize its text; indeterminate progress omits the value."},"1119":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-bar-26","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-bar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/progress-bar#accessibility","content":"`Text slot=\"description\"` is associated automatically, preserving external `aria-describedby` references."},"1120":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-steps","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-steps","type":"page","content":"ProgressSteps","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/progress-steps"},"1121":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-steps-0","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-steps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/progress-steps","content":"A multi-step progress indicator for wizard and onboarding flows."},"1122":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-steps-1","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-steps","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/progress-steps#features","content":"Features"},"1123":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-steps-2","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-steps","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/progress-steps#installation","content":"Installation"},"1124":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-steps-3","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-steps","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/progress-steps#examples","content":"Examples"},"1125":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-steps-4","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-steps","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/progress-steps#default","content":"Default"},"1126":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-steps-5","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-steps","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/progress-steps#not-started","content":"Not started"},"1127":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-steps-6","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-steps","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/progress-steps#vertical","content":"Vertical"},"1128":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-steps-7","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-steps","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/progress-steps#interactive","content":"Interactive"},"1129":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-steps-8","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-steps","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/progress-steps#disabled","content":"Disabled"},"1130":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-steps-9","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-steps","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/progress-steps#hide-step-numbers","content":"Hide Step Numbers"},"1131":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-steps-10","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-steps","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/progress-steps#customization","content":"Customization"},"1132":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-steps-11","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-steps","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/progress-steps#accessibility","content":"Accessibility"},"1133":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-steps-12","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-steps","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/progress-steps#best-practices","content":"Best Practices"},"1134":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-steps-13","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-steps","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/progress-steps#troubleshooting","content":"Troubleshooting"},"1135":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-steps-14","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-steps","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/progress-steps#props","content":"Props"},"1136":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-steps-15","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-steps","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/progress-steps#progresssteps","content":"ProgressSteps"},"1137":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-steps-16","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-steps","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/progress-steps#progressstep","content":"ProgressStep"},"1138":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-steps-17","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-steps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/progress-steps#features","content":"Horizontal and vertical orientations"},"1139":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-steps-18","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-steps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/progress-steps#features","content":"Four completion statuses (`none`, `partial`, `complete`, `error`) with status icons"},"1140":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-steps-19","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-steps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/progress-steps#features","content":"Timeline (past / current / future) derived from a single `currentStep` prop"},"1141":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-steps-20","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-steps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/progress-steps#features","content":"Auto-generated step numbers (opt out with `hideStepNumbers`)"},"1142":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-steps-21","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-steps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/progress-steps#features","content":"Interactive (navigable) and inert (display-only) steps"},"1143":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-steps-22","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-steps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/progress-steps#features","content":"Title truncation and RTL support"},"1144":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-steps-23","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-steps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/progress-steps#features","content":"Rendered as a `<nav>` landmark with an ordered list for assistive technology"},"1145":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-steps-24","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-steps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/progress-steps#default","content":"A horizontal stepper. `currentStep` marks the active step; earlier steps are `past`, later are `future`. Each `status` sets the step's icon, and an `error` step turns its accent bar red."},"1146":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-steps-25","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-steps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/progress-steps#not-started","content":"No `currentStep`: the flow hasn't started, so every step is `future` and none is marked current."},"1147":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-steps-26","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-steps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/progress-steps#vertical","content":"Vertical orientation: accent bar on the leading edge, steps stacked in a column."},"1148":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-steps-27","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-steps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/progress-steps#interactive","content":"Interactive steps: each `onPress` navigates the wizard by updating `currentStep`."},"1149":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-steps-28","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-steps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/progress-steps#disabled","content":"A disabled interactive step is muted, not focusable, and cannot be activated."},"1150":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-steps-29","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-steps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/progress-steps#hide-step-numbers","content":"Step numbers are shown by default; `hideStepNumbers` omits the \"N. \" prefix."},"1151":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-steps-30","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-steps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/progress-steps#customization","content":"Step numbers (`\"N. \"`) are prepended automatically — keep them where possible, as user testing shows people recognize the component better with them. Set `hideStepNumbers` to omit them."},"1152":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-steps-31","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-steps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/progress-steps#customization","content":"`orientation` switches between `horizontal` (accent bar on top) and `vertical` (accent bar on the leading edge)."},"1153":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-steps-32","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-steps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/progress-steps#customization","content":"`currentStep` is the single source of truth for the timeline. Omit it for a not-yet-started flow where every step is `future`; pass the step count for a fully completed flow where every step is `past`."},"1154":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-steps-33","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-steps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/progress-steps#customization","content":"`status` is independent of timeline and only controls the status icon and (for `error`) the accent bar color."},"1155":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-steps-34","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-steps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/progress-steps#customization","content":"Pass `className` to the container or an individual step to extend the styles."},"1156":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-steps-35","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-steps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/progress-steps#accessibility","content":"The container renders a `<nav>` landmark; set `aria-label` to name it (defaults to `\"Progress\"`)."},"1157":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-steps-36","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-steps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/progress-steps#accessibility","content":"Steps are an ordered list (`<ol>`/`<li>`) so assistive technology conveys position and count."},"1158":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-steps-37","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-steps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/progress-steps#accessibility","content":"The current step is marked with `aria-current=\"step\"`."},"1159":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-steps-38","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-steps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/progress-steps#accessibility","content":"Interactive steps are real buttons: focusable in the natural **Tab** order and activated with **Enter** or **Space**. Status icons are decorative (`aria-hidden`)."},"1160":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-steps-39",